15. Resource Protection

Review and tune:

CPU

Avoid excessive worker counts.

Memory

Use bounded queues.

Database

Ensure:

WorkerCount <= safe DB concurrency

and account for all other database consumers.

HTTP

Use:

IHttpClientFactory

where HTTP is involved.

MQ

Reuse connections appropriately while respecting client thread-safety.

File/S3/NFS

Avoid loading very large files entirely into memory.

Use streaming where practical.

